  <h2>Make It Truly Yours</h2>
  <p>Choosing stock products doesn't mean sacrificing brand identity. We offer a full suite of <strong>customization options for ready-to-ship activewear</strong> to ensure every piece feels unique to your brand.</p>
  
  <h3>Our Customization Capabilities</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Heat-Transfer Logos:</strong> High-durability logos placed exactly where you want them.</li>
    <li><strong>Custom Hangtags:</strong> Professional tags that communicate your brand story and price points.</li>
    <li><strong>Woven Wash Labels:</strong> Fully customized care labels with your brand name and origin details.</li>
    <li><strong>Branded Packaging:</strong> Custom polybags or sustainable mailing solutions to elevate the unboxing experience.</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>The Process</h3>
  <p>Simply send us your vector logo files and brand guidelines. We will provide a digital mockup for approval before applying the branding to your selected stock items.</p>

  <p>With Fitclo, "stock" becomes "custom" in a matter of days, giving you a professional brand presence with minimal lead time.</p>
